OL,3,GNEWSAE-scooters seized over town centre
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a dozen e-scooters have been
OL,7,Fseized by police in Shrewsbury
OL,8,Ffollowing reports of dangerous riding
OL,9,Fin the town centre.
OL,11,FWest Mercia Police said that although
OL,12,Fe-scooters are available to buy in
OL,13,FShropshire, they can only be ridden on
OL,14,Fprivate land with the owner's
OL,15,Fpermission and are illegal on public
OL,16,Froads, pavements, cycle lanes and
OL,17,Fpedestrian-only areas. There are no
OL,18,Flegal e-scooter rental services in the
OL,19,Fcounty.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
