OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAE-scooters seized over town centre
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said it would continue
OL,7,Fpatrolling the town centre during half
OL,8,Fterm and warned it could seize more.
OL,10,FInsp Ingrid Tozer, who is responsible
OL,11,Ffor Shrewsbury town centre, said the
OL,12,Fe-scooters were a risk to pedestrians
OL,13,Fand that a total of 14 and one e-bike
OL,14,Fhad been seized.
